{"parse": {"title": "TRC-10", "pageid": 6354, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/TRC-09\" title=\"TRC-09\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">TRC-10</span><a href=\"/wiki/TRC-11\" title=\"TRC-11\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">TRC</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">10</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.B0.8F.E7.A4.BC.E7.89.A9\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"小礼物\">小礼物</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 小礼物</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">A Small Gift</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>一<span class=\"color-value\"></span>份<span class=\"color-value\"></span>小<span class=\"color-value\"></span>小<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>心<span class=\"color-value\"></span>意<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>一<span class=\"color-value\"></span>点<span class=\"color-value\"></span>微<span class=\"color-value\"></span>不<span class=\"color-value\"></span>足<span class=\"color-value\"></span>道<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>帮<span class=\"color-value\"></span>助<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 1110110</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-zhanting_zhengmen.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"zhanting_zhengmen\"><img alt=\"zhanting_zhengmen\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/Cg-zhanting_zhengmen.png/600px-Cg-zhanting_zhengmen.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/Cg-zhanting_zhengmen.png/900px-Cg-zhanting_zhengmen.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/Cg-zhanting_zhengmen.png/1200px-Cg-zhanting_zhengmen.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>查尔顿先生与小狗们抵达了雷米特杯展览。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这理应是一次和谐的家庭聚会，大家都这么想。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>除了皮克勒斯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">温迪：</div><div>汪汪——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪汪……汪汪。<i>&lt;谢谢你的开导，温迪……但我对粉绿色的飞盘一点也不感兴趣。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">温迪：</div><div>汪、汪汪！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪汪。<i>&lt;你还没有意识到我们面临的核心问题。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>皮克勒斯瞥了瞥正在售票处忙活的查尔顿先生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪，汪汪。<i>&lt;他一点儿都不民主，也从来没有理解过我们的想法。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪汪……汪汪。<i>&lt;他把我们从书堆里、从小狗公园拉过来……就为了足球展览。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">温迪：</div><div>汪！汪！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小斗牛犬努力地拱着皮克勒斯的身体，示意对方向前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪汪汪，汪……<i>&lt;不，温迪，现在不是玩耍的时候……&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">温迪：</div><div>汪！汪！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>有更多的小狗从查尔顿身旁钻出来，把皮克勒斯围在了中间。他一向是最受欢迎的小狗。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/HeadIconSmall-611901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/HeadIconSmall-611901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/HeadIconSmall-611901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱丽丝：</div><div>汪——!</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"612001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-612001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-612001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"612001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-612001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-612001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-612001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-612001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳尔森：</div><div>汪汪！汪！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>嗯——？呜呜？<i>&lt;查尔顿也邀请了你们？你们也对足球感兴趣？&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小狗们整齐地点了点头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>呜……<i>&lt;我承认刚才的评价有些过头了……&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪……<i>&lt;但是……&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>皮克勒斯还想再说些什么，旁边查尔顿先生愤慨的抱怨声打断了他。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>你们的宣传单上明明写的是“我们欢迎每一位热爱足球运动的观众”！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">安保员：</div><div>是的，先生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>那你就应该让我们进去！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>我、温迪、爱丽丝、纳尔森，还有小皮克勒斯，我们都热爱足球！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">安保员：</div><div>很抱歉，宠物禁止入内。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">安保员：</div><div>我们准备了“宠物留存区”，甚至提供了专业的警犬看护。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>安保员指了指旁边巨大的笼子，里面堆满了各色的小型足球和小狗玩具。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一只黝黑的警犬懒洋洋地趴在门口。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>呃……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>查尔顿迟疑地拾起里面的一个柠檬黄色的足球玩具，用力捏了捏。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">温迪：</div><div>汪——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"612001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-612001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-612001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"612001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-612001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-612001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-612001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-612001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳尔森：</div><div>汪汪——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小斗牛犬跳起来叼走了查尔顿手里的球，积极地冲进了它的新乐园，其他小狗们也紧随其后。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玩具就是玩具，令人快乐的玩具。大家显然并不像人类那么在乎足球的大小与颜色。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>噢……别磕到头，温迪～</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>看样子我们都能有个不错的去处。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔顿：</div><div>祝你们在小狗乐园里玩得开心～</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>查尔顿朝着笼子的方向用力地挥了挥手，转身没入了游客队伍的人流之中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">温迪：</div><div>汪——！汪！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/HeadIconSmall-611901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/HeadIconSmall-611901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/HeadIconSmall-611901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱丽丝：</div><div>汪～</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪汪汪，汪。<i>&lt;这是个牢笼，朋友们，是可耻的区别对待。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/HeadIconSmall-611901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/HeadIconSmall-611901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/HeadIconSmall-611901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱丽丝：</div><div>汪、嗯……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"612001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-612001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-612001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"612001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-612001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-612001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-612001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-612001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳尔森：</div><div>汪汪……嗯！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪汪。<i>&lt;再多的玩具也无法改变这个事实。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>趴在门口的警犬拍了拍皮克勒斯的肩膀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">安保犬：</div><div>汪——呜！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪……吽吽。<i>&lt;我拒绝……你应该站在我们这边，而不是为人类的暴行做辩护。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">安保犬：</div><div>吽、吽吽……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>吽、吽吽……汪？<i>&lt;就算里面再危险，我们进入的权利也不应该被剥夺……等等，你说里面很危险？&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">安保犬：</div><div>汪——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>对方重重地点了点头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">温迪：</div><div>汪、汪汪！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/HeadIconSmall-611901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/HeadIconSmall-611901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/HeadIconSmall-611901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱丽丝：</div><div>呜呜……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪，汪汪。<i>&lt;好吧，我也确实闻到了奇怪的味道……像是某种烧焦的金属，又像是成堆的硝石。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">安保犬：</div><div>獒、獒獒……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>吽吽，吽？！<i>&lt;展馆里甚至多次传来了巨大的噪音与齿轮转动声……你们报告了这一情况吗？&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">安保犬：</div><div>獒！獒！……汪！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪汪汪，呜……<i>&lt;所有试图靠近负责人的同僚都被轰走了……你是唯一被留在这儿的……&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/HeadIconSmall-611901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/HeadIconSmall-611901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/HeadIconSmall-611901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱丽丝：</div><div>呜呜……？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"612001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-612001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-612001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"612001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-612001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-612001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-612001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-612001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">纳尔森：</div><div>汪——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小狗们听得很入神，它们七嘴八舌地展开了讨论。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>狺狺……狺。<i>&lt;这确实符合我在书中了解到的人类世界常有的论调……他们常有各种各样的阴谋假说。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>狺狺——！<i>&lt;反常封闭的展馆里，也许正酝酿着一场巨大的危机。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">安保犬：</div><div>汪！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>皮克勒斯像是突然想起了什么，他转头看向门口那条正在缓缓进入场馆的队伍。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>查尔顿先生的身影已经不在其中了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">安保犬：</div><div>呜……呜呜～</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪汪……汪。<i>&lt;展厅后门可能会有溜进去的办法……谢谢你告诉我，我现在就出发。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-zhanting_houmen.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"zhanting_houmen\"><img alt=\"zhanting_houmen\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/Cg-zhanting_houmen.png/600px-Cg-zhanting_houmen.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/Cg-zhanting_houmen.png/900px-Cg-zhanting_houmen.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5d/Cg-zhanting_houmen.png/1200px-Cg-zhanting_houmen.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>皮克勒斯展现出了作为边境牧羊犬的优良素质。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他身手矫健地避开了所有的荆棘与护栏，像一个真正的英雄。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>狺……狺狺。<i>&lt;呼……这应该是展馆早已废弃的后门。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>狺狺。<i>&lt;但愿我没浪费太多的时间。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>狺狺，狺……<i>&lt;防护网能够直率地拒绝一切不受欢迎之人……&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>皮克勒斯的目光落到了那个破开的小洞上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>狺～<i>&lt;但它总算对小狗们网开一面。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>树上偶尔会有苹果落下，这应该属于常识。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>我们又见面了……有着忧郁眼神的小狗。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪汪——？<i>&lt;苹果先生，您怎么会在这儿？&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>APPLe某受船长之托，先行进入场馆调查情况。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>呜——？汪汪！<i>&lt;您也意识到了这个展馆内的危机吗？看来我的预感并没有错！&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>对了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>自从上次分开之后，APPLe某就一直在思考与你交流的方法。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>我制作了这个。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>一个简易的翻译器——“Doggie”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>它仍处于测试阶段，功能并不完善，时有故障。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>对犬类语言的理解也存在一定偏差……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>APPLe把翻译器递给了皮克勒斯，短暂的犹豫之后，皮克勒斯接过了它。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪汪……汪。<i>&lt;尽管我并没有频繁与人类交流的想法……但谢谢您，APPLe先生。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"615901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"615901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">\"Doggie\"：</div><div>小狗表达了他的感谢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>不用谢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>但可惜的是，APPLe某现在并没有多余的时间来测试它的效果。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>你最好尽快离开，这儿随时可能出现滥用暴力的安保机器人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>呜。<i>&lt;我不能走。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"615901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"615901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">\"Doggie\"：</div><div>小狗拒绝了你的建议。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>嗯？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪汪、汪……<i>&lt;查尔顿……他还在里面……&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>狺……狺狺……<i>&lt;虽然他是个不太合格的主人……虽然他有各种各样的坏毛病……&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪汪……<i>&lt;但我不能忽视他可能遇到的危险……&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪汪……汪汪……<i>&lt;温迪和其他小狗们会伤心的……它们依赖查尔顿的照顾……&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"615901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"615901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">\"Doggie\"：</div><div>里面有着对小狗来说非常重要的东西。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>…………</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小狗陷入了沉默。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>原来如此，这是一个合理的理由。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>让我们一同前进吧，在出现危险的时候APPLe某会尽可能帮助你的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>APPLe落在皮克勒斯的背上，他们都做好了准备。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-at_xiaogoutuopingguo.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"at_xiaogoutuopingguo\"><img alt=\"at_xiaogoutuopingguo\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/Cg-at_xiaogoutuopingguo.png/600px-Cg-at_xiaogoutuopingguo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/Cg-at_xiaogoutuopingguo.png/900px-Cg-at_xiaogoutuopingguo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/Cg-at_xiaogoutuopingguo.png/1200px-Cg-at_xiaogoutuopingguo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>简单地助跑之后，皮克勒斯在空中划出一个完美的弧线，轻松地穿过了破损的防盗网。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>唔——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪汪……<i>&lt;谢谢您的翻译器，苹果先生……&gt;</i></div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "TRC-10"}}